  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;has roots&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></math>. Therefore,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p><p>Since the given system of equations has non-trivial solutions,</p><p>we have&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#947;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#947;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#947;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>/</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p>",
